 d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></button><button type="button" title="AI" aria-label="AI" aria-pressed="false" class="relative inline-flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:shadow-ring text-fg-muted hover:bg-bg-subtle hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg></button><button type="button" title="Syntax" aria-label="Syntax" aria-pressed="false" class="relative inline-flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:shadow-ring text-fg-muted hover:bg-bg-subtle hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v16"></path><path d="M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z"></path></svg></button><button type="button" title="Templates" aria-label="Templates" aria-pressed="true" class="relative inline-flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:shadow-ring bg-primary-subtle text-primary-hover"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layout-template size-4" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="7" x="3" y="3" rx="1"></rect><rect width="9" height="7" x="3" y="14" rx="1"></rect><rect width="5" height="7" x="16" y="14" rx="1"></rect></svg></button></nav><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg shadow-sm overflow-hidden"><div data-testid="dynamic-stub"></div></div><div class="hidden w-[26rem] shrink-0 lg:flex"><aside class="flex h-full min-h-0 w-full min-w-0 flex-col rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg shadow-sm" aria-label="Toggle side panel"><header class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-border px-3 py-2"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layout-template size-4 shrink-0 text-fg-muted" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="7" x="3" y="3" rx="1"></rect><rect width="9" height="7" x="3" y="14" rx="1"></rect><rect width="5" height="7" x="16" y="14" rx="1"></rect></svg><span class="truncate text-sm font-medium text-fg">Templates</span></div><button type="button" aria-label="Toggle side panel" class="shrink-0 rounded p-1 text-fg-muted hover:bg-bg-subtle hover:text-fg focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:shadow-ring"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></header><div class="min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto"><div class="p-3"><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg shadow-sm"><div class="space-y-4 px-5 py-5"><p class="text-xs text-fg-muted">Picking a template clears the editor and replaces its content.</p><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-subtle">Getting started</h3><ul class="space-y-1"><li><button type="button" class="w-full rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-bg-subtle focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:shadow-ring"><div class="text-sm font-medium text-fg">Basic starter</div><div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-fg-muted">A short loan rule to learn the syntax: one type, one rule, nested conditions</div></button></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-subtle">Loan</h3><ul class="space-y-1"><li><button type="button" class="w-full rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-bg-subtle focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:shadow-ring"><div class="text-sm font-medium text-fg">Loan Evaluation</div><div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-fg-muted">Evaluate loan applications based on credit score and age</div></button></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-subtle">Credit Card</h3><ul class="space-y-1"><li><button type="button" class="w-full rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-bg-subtle focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:shadow-ring"><div class="text-sm font-medium text-fg">Credit Card Application</div><div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-fg-muted">Evaluate credit card applications and determine credit limits</div></button></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-subtle">Fraud Detection</h3><ul class="space-y-1"><li><button type="button" class="w-full rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-bg-subtle focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:shadow-ring"><div class="text-sm font-medium text-fg">Fraud Detection</div><div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-fg-muted">Detect potentially fraudulent transactions</div></button></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-subtle">Healthcare</h3><ul class="space-y-1"><li><button type="button" class="w-full rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-bg-subtle focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:shadow-ring"><div class="text-sm font-medium text-fg">Healthcare Eligibility</div><div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-fg-muted">Check patient eligibility for medical services</div></button></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-subtle">Auto Insurance</h3><ul class="space-y-1"><li><button type="button" class="w-full rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-bg-subtle focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:shadow-ring"><div class="text-sm font-medium text-fg">Auto Insurance Quote</div><div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-fg-muted">Generate auto insurance quotes based on driver and vehicle information</div></button></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-subtle">Showcase</h3><ul class="space-y-1"><li><div data-testid="template-locked-showcase-jingyesi" aria-disabled="true" class="rounded-md border border-dashed border-border px-2 py-1.5 opacity-80"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="text-sm font-medium text-fg">Quiet Night Thoughts (Chinese showcase)</div><div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-fg-muted">Li Bai’s poem, word for word, is the source of a Chinese (zh-CN) policy, and running it outputs the title 静夜思. Four keyword aliases turn the opening words of the lines into keywords. The policy’s own vocabulary maps 望明月 to the Text type and expands the literal 思故乡 to "静夜思". A display layout hides the spaces the aliases need, so the policy reads as the original poem.</div></div><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 rounded bg-bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-fg-muted"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Locked</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">Needs structured authoring. An administrator grants it per user.</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">Needs permission for structural keyword aliases.</p><p class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 text-xs"><a href="/docs/guides/structured-authoring-admin" class="font-medium text-primary underline hover:no-underline">Structured authoring access</a><a href="/docs/guides/display-layouts" class="font-medium text-primary underline hover:no-underline">Display layouts</a></p></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></aside></div></div><footer data-testid="policy-status-bar" class="ml-4 sm:ml-6 mr-4 sm:mr-6 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-subtle px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-fg-muted" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span>5 lines</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-fg-subtle">·</span><span>CNL EN-US</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-fg-subtle">·</span><span class="ml-auto flex items-center gap-3"><button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="true" aria-label="AI inline completion" title="Suggests the next code while you type; each pause uses AI quota. Click to toggle." data-testid="status-ai-completion-toggle" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-1 -mx-1 hover:bg-bg-muted focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:shadow-ring disabled:opacity-50 text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>AI completion: on</button><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-fg-subtle">·</span><span class="font-mono text-[11px]">⌘S to save</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-fg-subtle">·</span><span class="font-mono text-[11px]">⌘K for commands</span></span></footer><dialog class="m-0 w-full max-w-xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg p-0 shadow-2xl shadow-primary/20 backdrop:bg-zinc-950/40 backdrop:backdrop-blur-sm fixed left-1/2 top-[20vh] -translate-x-1/2"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-border px-4 py-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search size-4 shrink-0 text-fg-muted" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg><input placeholder="Type a command…" class="flex-1 bg-transparent text-sm text-fg outline-none placeholder:text-fg-subtle" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" type="text" value=""><kbd class="hidden rounded border border-border bg-bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-fg-muted sm:inline-block">ESC</kbd></div><div class="max-h-[60vh] overflow-y-auto p-2"><div class="py-1"><p class="px-3 pb-1 pt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-subtle">AI</p><ul><li><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center gap-3 rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-left transition-colors duration-fast bg-primary-subtle text-fg"><span class="shrink-0 text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="2